<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><meta name="theme-color" content="#050b13"><title>Global Sourcing & International Trade Facilitation | SAHJONY</title><meta name="description" content="SAHJONY Global Trade helps businesses source worldwide, qualify counterparties, structure RFQs, compare commercial terms and coordinate international trade execution."><link rel="canonical" href="https://www.sahjony.com/"><meta property="og:type" content="website"><meta property="og:title" content="SAHJONY Global Trade — Worldwide Sourcing & Trade Facilitation"><meta property="og:description" content="Tell us what your business needs. We qualify, source and structure the next commercial step."><meta property="og:url" content="https://www.sahjony.com/"><meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image"><script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Organization","name":"SAHJONY Global Trade","url":"https://www.sahjony.com/","description":"Worldwide sourcing, counterparty qualification and international trade facilitation.","areaServed":"Worldwide","knowsAbout":["Global sourcing","Supplier qualification","Buyer qualification","Import export","Trade facilitation","RFQ management","International logistics"]}</script><style>:root{--bg:#050b13;--p:#091827;--p2:#0e2235;--l:rgba(255,255,255,.1);--t:#f7fbff;--m:#9aafbf;--g:#70efb0;--c:#5ad8ff;--gold:#ddb96d}*{box-sizing:border-box}html{scroll-behavior:smooth}body{margin:0;background:radial-gradient(circle at 82% 0,rgba(221,185,109,.14),transparent 27%),radial-gradient(circle at 10% 0,rgba(90,216,255,.12),transparent 30%),var(--bg);color:var(--t);font-family:Inter,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,"Segoe UI",sans-serif}a{text-decoration:none;color:inherit}.nav{position:sticky;top:0;z-index:20;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:14px;padding:15px max(20px,calc((100vw - 1380px)/2));background:rgba(5,11,19,.9);border-bottom:1px solid var(--l);backdrop-filter:blur(18px)}.brand{font-weight:950;letter-spacing:.14em;font-size:13px}.navlinks{display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap}.navlinks a{padding:9px 10px;color:#bccbd5;font-size:11px}.btn{display:inline-flex;padding:13px 16px;border-radius:11px;border:1px solid var(--l);font-size:12px;font-weight:900}.primary{background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--gold),#f0d89a);color:#071019;border:0}.hero{max-width:1380px;margin:auto;padding:88px 22px 62px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.12fr .88fr;gap:42px;align-items:center}.ey{font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.2em;color:var(--gold);font-weight:900}.hero h1{font-size:clamp(54px,7.4vw,108px);line-height:.88;letter-spacing:-.064em;margin:16px 0 24px}.hero h1 span{color:var(--gold)}.hero p{font-size:18px;line-height:1.72;color:#b6c7d3;max-width:820px}.actions{display:flex;gap:9px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:28px}.proof{display:flex;gap:7px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:20px}.proof span{font-size:9px;color:#a8bac8;border:1px solid var(--l);padding:7px 9px;border-radius:999px}.signal{border:1px solid var(--l);border-radius:22px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,var(--p2),#071522);padding:24px}.signal small{color:var(--c);font-weight:900;letter-spacing:.15em}.signal h2{font-size:30px;margin:10px 0}.signal .row{padding:14px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--l)}.signal .row strong{display:block;font-size:13px}.signal .row span{color:var(--m);font-size:10px}.section{max-width:1380px;margin:auto;padding:72px 22px;border-top:1px solid var(--l)}.section h2{font-size:clamp(38px,5vw,68px);letter-spacing:-.045em;line-height:.95;margin:10px 0 25px}.grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:10px}.card{border:1px solid var(--l);border-radius:16px;background:var(--p);padding:20px}.card small{color:var(--c);font-size:8px;letter-spacing:.13em}.card h3{font-size:19px;margin:9px 0}.card p{font-size:10px;line-height:1.6;color:var(--m)}.card a{font-size:11px;color:var(--gold);font-weight:850}.flow{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(5,1fr);gap:8px}.flow div{padding:15px;border:1px solid var(--l);border-radius:12px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.02);font-size:10px;color:#bfd0db}.flow b{display:block;color:var(--gold);font-size:9px;margin-bottom:5px}.cta{max-width:1380px;margin:16px auto 70px;padding:52px 22px;text-align:center;border:1px solid rgba(221,185,109,.25);border-radius:22px;background:radial-gradient(circle at 50% 0,rgba(221,185,109,.12),transparent 50%),var(--p)}.cta h2{font-size:clamp(38px,5vw,68px);letter-spacing:-.05em;margin:8px auto 16px;max-width:900px}.cta p{color:var(--m);max-width:760px;margin:auto;line-height:1.6}.footer{padding:24px max(20px,calc((100vw - 1380px)/2));border-top:1px solid var(--l);font-size:9px;color:#718899}@media(max-width:900px){.hero{grid-template-columns:1fr}.grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.flow{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}.navlinks a:not(.btn){display:none}}@media(max-width:620px){.hero{padding:62px 14px 44px}.hero h1{font-size:50px}.hero p{font-size:16px}.section{padding:55px 14px}.flow{grid-template-columns:1fr}.cta{margin:10px 14px 55px}}</style></head><body><header class="nav"><a class="brand" href="/">SAHJONY GLOBAL TRADE</a><nav class="navlinks"><a href="/global-sourcing">Global Sourcing</a><a href="/suppliers">Suppliers</a><a href="/partners">Partners</a><a class="btn primary" href="/start">Submit Requirement</a></nav></header><main><section class="hero"><div><div class="ey">WORLDWIDE SOURCING · COUNTERPARTY QUALIFICATION · TRADE FACILITATION</div><h1>Tell us what your business needs.<br><span>We source the world.</span></h1><p>SAHJONY helps international businesses qualify requirements and counterparties, structure RFQs, compare verified commercial terms and coordinate controlled trade execution across eligible origins and destinations.</p><div class="actions"><a class="btn primary" href="/start">I need to source</a><a class="btn" href="/suppliers">I want to supply</a><a class="btn" href="/partners">I have an opportunity</a></div><div class="proof"><span>Worldwide sourcing</span><span>Buyer & supplier qualification</span><span>RFQ-to-quote workflow</span><span>Compliance gates</span><span>Human-approved commitments</span></div></div><aside class="signal"><small>TRADE CONVERSION ENGINE</small><h2>From inquiry to executable opportunity.</h2><div class="row"><strong>Buyer demand</strong><span>Requirement · quantity · destination · timeline · commercial terms</span></div><div class="row"><strong>Supplier capability</strong><span>Capability · MOQ · documentation · capacity · terms · lead time</span></div><div class="row"><strong>SAHJONY structure</strong><span>Qualification · matching · quote comparison · logistics · controlled closing</span></div></aside></section><section class="section"><div class="ey">HIGH-INTENT ENTRY POINTS</div><h2>One platform. Three ways to create business.</h2><div class="grid"><article class="card"><small>BUYERS</small><h3>Submit a requirement</h3><p>Tell us what you need and let SAHJONY qualify the commercial requirement before sourcing begins.</p><a href="/start">Start sourcing →</a></article><article class="card"><small>SUPPLIERS</small><h3>Present your capability</h3><p>Register export-ready capabilities, documentation, capacity and commercial terms for matching.</p><a href="/suppliers">Supplier intake →</a></article><article class="card"><small>PARTNERS</small><h3>Bring an opportunity</h3><p>Introduce a qualified commercial requirement or supply relationship for governed review.</p><a href="/partners">Partner intake →</a></article></div></section><section class="section"><div class="ey">CONTROLLED EXECUTION</div><h2>Built to move qualified opportunities toward revenue.</h2><div class="flow"><div><b>01</b>Inquiry</div><div><b>02</b>AI qualification</div><div><b>03</b>CRM + RFQ</div><div><b>04</b>Counterparty match</div><div><b>05</b>Verified quote</div><div><b>06</b>Compliance</div><div><b>07</b>Negotiation</div><div><b>08</b>Human approval</div><div><b>09</b>Execution</div><div><b>10</b>Revenue evidence</div></div></section><section class="cta"><div class="ey">READY TO START?</div><h2>Bring us a real business requirement. We will structure the next commercial step.</h2><p>Start with the requirement, approximate quantity, destination and contact information. No availability, price, payment or shipment commitment is created by submitting an inquiry.</p><div class="actions" style="justify-content:center"><a class="btn primary" href="/start">Submit requirement</a><a class="btn" href="/suppliers">Register supply</a></div></section></main><footer class="footer">SAHJONY Global Trade · Worldwide sourcing and trade facilitation · Availability depends on counterparties, origin, destination, authorization and applicable law.</footer><script src="/global-language.js" defer></script></body></html>